<view class="page recap-page"><text class="eyebrow">STORIES WE KEEP</text><text class="display-title">把散落的日子，&#10;装订成一章</text><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sync-status"><view class="sync-dot"></view><text>正在同步年度回顾</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status-banner status-banner--error" role="alert"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="onShow">重试</button></view><view class="year-cover {{recap.status === 'READY' ? 'ready' : ''}}"><view class="cover-top"><text>LOVE NOTES</text><text>VOL. {{recap.version}}</text></view><text class="cover-year">{{recap.year}}</text><view class="cover-orbit"><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view></view><text class="cover-title">{{recap.title}}</text><text class="cover-meta">{{count}} 段共同可见时刻 · {{recap.status === 'READY' ? '已生成' : '草稿'}}</text><button class="cover-action press" bindtap="openCover">{{recap.status === 'READY' ? '打开回顾' : '继续编辑'}} ›</button></view><view class="recap-section"><view><text class="section-title">制作新的回顾</text><text class="section-note">私密内容永不进入双人回顾；争执和低落片段默认排除。</text></view><button class="new-recap press" bindtap="create"><text>＋</text><view><text>2026 年度回顾</text><text class="label">{{paired ? (count < 3 ? '素材不多，也可以亲手选择' : '从候选时刻开始') : '配对后可用'}}</text></view></button></view><view class="recap-principles"><text>候选筛选</text><view><view class="decor">1</view><text class="label">只使用共同可见记录</text></view><view><view class="decor">2</view><text class="label">敏感片段默认排除</text></view><view><view class="decor">3</view><text class="label">分享前逐项检查披露内容</text></view></view></view>
